          "abridged": false,
          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "It’s the last week of camp, and that means it’s time for the OWLympics! The beloved camp tradition splits The Hoot staff into rival teams—two on Team Red and two on Team Blue—bent on besting each other through non-stop competition, cheers, and challenges. But they manage to come together to solve a final mystery of the summer: Who’s trying to sabotage the OWLympics? To find out, they’ll have to rely on each other to solve the highest-stakes mystery they’ve encountered yet—and figure out how to say goodbye. ",
